The validation reference is generated with the Neurodesk OpenRecon TopoFit
0.5.1 container. The OpenNeuro ds000001 input is distributed under PDDL 1.0.

Cortical patch geometry and normal estimation are adapted from Neurodesk's
OpenRecon TopoFit recipe:
https://github.com/neurodesk/neurocontainers/tree/main/recipes/topofit
The fsaverage sphere and cortex labels are distributed separately on Hugging
Face. Original asset checksums and sources are in cortex-atlas.manifest.json.
FreeSurfer software license and attribution:
https://surfer.nmr.mgh.harvard.edu/fswiki/FreeSurferSoftwareLicense

The fsaverage search-region labels (fsaverage-regions.bin) are distributed
separately on Hugging Face; sources and checksums are in
cortex-regions.manifest.json.
